\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Mechanistic overview of the v7 study design. The strict external branch trains on CPTAC RNA+clinical features and transfers six scRNA-derived marker programs into a prior-guided kernel transformer, while the CPTAC ablation branch separately measures the incremental contribution of methylation and scRNA-derived scores.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
